{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type ListenerTriggerOption<TTriggers, TFormData, TValue> = \n  | TTriggers\n| ListenerTriggerConfig<TTriggers, TFormData, TValue>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L124","children":[{"type":"text","value":"listeners.public.ts:124"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A listener event, optionally paired with a condition that enables it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A string enables the trigger unconditionally. Use the object form to add a\nboolean or predicate condition. Omitting "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"when"},{"type":"text","value":" from the object form also\nenables the trigger unconditionally."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"ttriggers","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TTriggers"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TTriggers"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"FieldListenerTriggers.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"FieldListenerTriggers"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Library-managed. Do not specify explicitly."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tformdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TFormData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFormData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Library-managed. Do not specify explicitly."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tvalue","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TValue"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TValue"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Library-managed. Do not specify explicitly."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"triggers: [\n  'blur',\n  {\n    trigger: 'change',\n    when: ({ formApi }) => formApi.state.isDirty,\n  },\n],","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"ttriggers","text":"TTriggers","level":3},{"id":"tformdata","text":"TFormData","level":3},{"id":"tvalue","text":"TValue","level":3},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype ListenerTriggerOption<TTriggers, TFormData, TValue> = \n  | TTriggers\n| ListenerTriggerConfig<TTriggers, TFormData, TValue>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:124](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L124)\n\nA listener event, optionally paired with a condition that enables it.\n\nA string enables the trigger unconditionally. Use the object form to add a\nboolean or predicate condition. Omitting `when` from the object form also\nenables the trigger unconditionally.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TTriggers\n\n`TTriggers` *extends* [`FieldListenerTriggers`](FieldListenerTriggers.md)\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\ntriggers: [\n  'blur',\n  {\n    trigger: 'change',\n    when: ({ formApi }) => formApi.state.isDirty,\n  },\n],\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ListenerTriggerOption\ntitle: ListenerTriggerOption\n---\n\n```ts\ntype ListenerTriggerOption<TTriggers, TFormData, TValue> = \n  | TTriggers\n| ListenerTriggerConfig<TTriggers, TFormData, TValue>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:124](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L124)\n\nA listener event, optionally paired with a condition that enables it.\n\nA string enables the trigger unconditionally. Use the object form to add a\nboolean or predicate condition. Omitting `when` from the object form also\nenables the trigger unconditionally.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TTriggers\n\n`TTriggers` *extends* [`FieldListenerTriggers`](FieldListenerTriggers.md)\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\ntriggers: [\n  'blur',\n  {\n    trigger: 'change',\n    when: ({ formApi }) => formApi.state.isDirty,\n  },\n],\n```\n"}
